  "description": "The application is for gates (black metal) to the property which already has an existing wall. \n\nThe reason for the application is to improve the security of the property as there is a park directly opposite (developed by Westminster council in the last 3 years) which attracts large groups of people some of whom have entered our property and vandalised, damaged and stolen various items of property, furniture and other goods.   Gates would allow all of these to be securely protected. \n\nThis application is in keeping with the local immediate environment as all the houses in the street as well as parts of the park itself have gates and railings to protect and define their boundaries. \n\nThe gates will be in the same style and scale as those immediately nearby. ",
